  "id": "banana-smoothie",
  "name": "Banana Smoothie",
  "subtitle": "A creamy banana drink with vanilla and cinnamon",
  "description": "Blend banana, milk, vanilla, sugar, and egg into a smooth drink, then finish with cinnamon. If the egg is not pasteurized, heat the blended mixture to 160°F before serving.",
